{"title":"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nThe sum </p><center><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a75ada4d14537951997bb6be501de00e463f55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{2007} \\arctan\\left(\\frac{1}{k^2+k+1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"190\" height=\"50\" /></p></center><p> can be written in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06ac14003f76f1fa0245005b27838e0ec16b2ba5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\arctan\\left(\\frac{m}{n}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"91\" height=\"33\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a7986370c73f39e8e4cc79eaa379bac4e14eec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(m,n) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />. Compute the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by 100.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First let us develop a formula for sums of arctans. Let us say we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/0/770296cf250004f7b7509e31b1dee83567c433f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan^{-1}{a} - \\tan^{-1}{b}$\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />, so we take the tangent of that and you get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9e6b083cd8402e4bbecde3c1b9410189053ec89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan(\\tan^{-1}{a} - \\tan^{-1}{b}) = \\frac{a - b}{1 + ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"253\" height=\"41\" />, now if we take the arctan of both sides we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/2/dd22aed45e5c04da9187401e23666a2a7da24727.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan^{-1}{a} - \\tan^{-1}{b} = \\tan^{-1}{\\frac{a - b}{1 + ab}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"256\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>If we say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d36ed8cb7a2b401197a08a73cd16bd2ace8e59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_k = \\tan^{-1}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"17\" />, then we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db20f7adfdde364610e51dd06bb8ea9cbff53b82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{(x_{k+1} - x_k)} = \\frac{\\tan{x_{k+1}} - \\tan{x_{k}}}{1 + \\tan{x_{k+1}} \\tan{x_{k}}} = \\frac{1}{k^2 + k + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"402\" height=\"41\" /> \n</p><p>Therefore the sum telescopes leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/b/7cb67c2279ee67836093d46519c4dca6ff574c11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{2007}\\tan^{-1}{\\frac{1}{k^2 + k + 1}} = \\tan^{-1}{2008} - \\tan^{-1}{1} = \\tan^{-1}{\\frac{2007}{1 + 2008}} = \\frac{2007}{2009}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"553\" height=\"50\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/6/c066b9b9c6b90f79128872be022fb6cec140478f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007 + 2009 \\equiv \\fbox{016}(\\mod 100)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"248\" height=\"22\" />\n</p><p>i don't know if my answer is right as there is no answer key for this test. \n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 14\"> Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\"> Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems\">Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017233857\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2409/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4423:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017233857 and revision id 26798. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}